Each block below runs EXPLAIN ANALYZE on one of the seven queries,
AFTER the indexes in indexes.sql were created.
Look for: Index Scan and Bitmap Index Scan nodes replacing the
Seq Scan nodes you saw before, lower execution time in ms, and
lower actual rows removed by filters.

Paste each plan into before_after_table.md under the After
columns, next to the matching BEFORE plan from explain_before.sql.

